    "en": "In the past 8 hours the ecosystem added 37 new plugins and the official repo gained 325 stars alongside a 0.1.6-alpha.2 release; desktop projects led growth (dataelement/dsh-desktop +72 stars). With 12,110 of 15,453 non-fork plugins stale for 7+ days and a health score of 38, activity remains worth watching.",
